job.description:
We are looking for a motivated and creative Graphic Designer Intern to join our Marketing team. Graphic design is one of the pillars in the creation of content. As a graphic designer at BekaertDeslee, it is your responsibility to design visual content for print and digital applications that is on-brand, reinforces our status and reputation, design and layout of materials for internal communications, design and layout of essential business materials and presentation materials and video clips editing for use on social media platforms.

Marketing

Waregem, Belgium

### **Job description**

* Creating visually appealing slides for presentations;
* Creating illustrations and visuals for events and social media, by working within the BekaertDeslee brand guidelines;
* Taking pictures of the fabrics
* Adjusting branded materials and slides into new campaign branding;
* Adjusting visuals in Photoshop and Illustrator;
* Creating documents in InDesign;
* Suggesting out of the box ideas

### **Profile**

Do you see the digital transformation of our environment as an opportunity? Do you have good organizational skills and a great eye for detail? Are you a real team player with a creative mindset? Then you might be the person we are looking for!

* You’re a final-year Bachelor’s student or Master’s student with studies in the field of graphic design or other studies but with knowledge of graphic design software;
* Managing multiple tasks and projects with attention to detail and follow up;
* You’re familiar with Adobe InDesign, Adobe Photoshop and Adobe Illustrator; knowledge of photography is a plus
* You’re a real team player with a creative mindset;
* You have good organizational skills and a great eye for detail;
* You have a good digital understanding and the ability to use technology;
* You’re able to express yourself fluently in English;
* Flexibility and willingness to work from our office in Waregem on a regular basis, a few days per week.
* You’re looking for an internship for at least 3 months

### **Our offer**

At BekaertDeslee, we value innovation, collaboration, and a commitment to excellence. This internship offers a valuable opportunity to develop and apply your graphic design & marketing skills in a real-world business setting. You will work with a dynamic team and gain experience across multiple digital marketing disciplines, making a meaningful impact on our company's digital growth. If you are passionate about digital marketing and excited to learn, this role is a perfect fit for you!

**Important:** We can only host students that are currently studying in Belgium. **Please consider that our internship is unpaid.**
